{title: Reckless Love (FJ_75_en)}
{song_number: 75}
{language: en}
{tempo: 166}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[Bm7]Before I spoke a word, [A]You were singing over me.
[G]You have been [Bm7]so, so good [A]to me.
[Bm7]Before I took a breath, [A]You breathed Your life in me.
[G]You have been [Bm7]so, so kind [A]to me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[Bm7]When I was Your foe, [A]still Your love fought for me.
[G]You have been [Bm7]so, so good [A]to me.
[Bm7]When I felt no worth, [A]You paid it all for me.
[G]You have been [Bm7]so, so kind [A]to me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Bm7]Oh, the overwhelming, [A]never-ending, [G]reckless love of God.
[D]Oh, it chases me down, [Bm7]fights till I am found, [A]leaves the ninety-[G]nine.
[D]I could not earn it, I do not deserve it, still You [A]give Yourself [G]away.
[Bm7]Oh, the overwhelming, [A]never-ending, [G]reckless love of [D]God.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[Bm7]There is no shadow You will not light up, [A]mountain You will not climb up,
[G]coming after [D]me.
[Bm7]There is no wall You will not kick down, [A]lie You will not tear down,
[G]coming after [D]me.
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus}
[Bm7]Oh, the overwhelming, [A]never-ending, [G]reckless love of God.
[D]Oh, it chases me down, [Bm7]fights till I am found, [A]leaves the ninety-[G]nine.
[D]I could not earn it, I do not deserve it, still You [A]give Yourself [G]away.
[Bm7]Oh, the overwhelming, [A]never-ending, [G]reckless love of [D]God.
{end_of_chorus}
